  "question": {
    "text": "If the two circles $(x-1)^2+(y-3)^2=r^2$ and $x^2+y^2-8 x+2 y+8=0$ intersect in two distinct point, then",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "CBNzm",
      "text": "\n$r>2$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "W9AcF",
      "text": "\n$2 < \\mathrm{r} < 8$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "RlcgP",
      "text": "\n$r < 2$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "0jyOk",
      "text": "\n$\\mathrm{r}=2$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\left|r_1-r_2\\right|=C_1 C_2$ for intersection\n$\\Rightarrow \\mathrm{r}-3 < 5 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{r} < 8$<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/SVLvD9fJd6HcLEPMM69A_Pxkd1bMBs6Da4d7WXGJqrQ.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\nand $\\mathrm{r}_1+\\mathrm{r}_2>\\mathrm{C}_1 \\mathrm{C}_2, \\mathrm{r}+3>5 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{r}=2$<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/VrlxA7Koxe6479MEM7PEccGdyQNYP4ZnydEl0lX7lag.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\nFrom (1) and (2), $2 < \\mathrm{r} < 8$.",
    "image": null
  },
